    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730">

                <pb facs="0696" n="606" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg606"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1314</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Tiflis</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 82</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tiflis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-09"><hi rendition="#italic">January 9, 1918</hi></date>.
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 18.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: For the Department’s information, I have
                    the honor to enclose herewith a copy of a personal letter addressed by me to Mr.
                    Kharlamov. Being unable to leave Tiflis, and acting in accordance with the
                    Department’s cabled instruction of November 9, 1917, I sent Mr. Doolittle<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d730-f1"/> to Vladikavkaz and Ekaterinodar to obtain
                    information <pb facs="0697" n="607" xml:id="pg607"/> on conditions there. My
                    letter to Kharlamov, with whom I am in personal friendly relations, was written
                    at the request of the heads of the British and French military missions here. A
                    report on Mr. Doolittle’s mission was cabled to the Department yesterday.</p>
                <p>Trusting my action will be approved by the Department, I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Willoughby Smith</hi></signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d730-a1.xml" xpointer="d730-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
